@startuml
!include theme.puml
title Authentication | Login, delegation and refresh reuse
autonumber
actor User
participant "React SPA\nAuthProvider / apiClient" as UI
participant "Nginx gateway" as GW
participant "Identity API" as ID
database identity_db as DB
participant "Domain API" as API
User -> UI : Submit email/password
UI -> GW : POST /api/v1/auth/login
GW -> ID : Public login; 5/min IP budget
ID -> DB : Platform credential lookup
ID -> ID : Active + lockout + Argon2 checks
alt Valid credentials
  ID -> DB : Reset failures; INSERT refresh hash + family\nCOMMIT
  ID --> UI : Access JWT + HttpOnly refresh cookie
  UI -> UI : Store access JWT in memory; fetch principal
else Bad password
  ID -> DB : Increment failures; lock after threshold\nCOMMIT
  ID --> UI : 401 (lockout: default 15 minutes)
end
UI -> GW : Protected request + bearer JWT
GW -> ID : Internal auth_request /internal/verify
ID --> GW : Verified user/tenant headers or 401
GW -> API : Authorized request + original bearer token
API -> API : Independently verify RS256 / issuer /\naudience / expiry; set tenant DB context
API --> UI : Domain response
group Refresh after a resource response is 401
  UI -> GW : POST /api/v1/auth/refresh + cookie\nsingle in-flight promise per JS runtime
  GW -> ID : Public refresh route
  ID -> DB : Read stored token hash
  alt Active unexpired refresh token
    ID -> DB : Revoke old row; INSERT successor\nsame family; COMMIT
    ID --> UI : New access token + replacement cookie
    UI -> GW : Retry original request ONCE
  else Reused revoked token
    ID -> DB : Revoke active rows in family; COMMIT
    ID --> UI : 401
    UI -> UI : Session-expired callback;\nProtectedRoute redirects to /login
  end
end
note over UI,API
Logout revokes the presented refresh row, not every issued access JWT.
Multi-tab refresh coordination is not provided by the single-runtime promise.
Secure-cookie production configuration remains a release gate.
end note
@enduml
